1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,966
Part fourteen. Installation.

2
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:07,194
On the project, tap Schedule installation.

3
00:00:07,194 --> 00:00:12,521
Choose the date and the lead technician, and the team members going to site.

4
00:00:13,410 --> 00:00:20,405
At the site, tick each step as it is done: structure, panels, inverter, cabling,

5
00:00:20,405 --> 00:00:24,340
earthing, testing, and briefing the customer.

6
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:28,886
Tap Use my location to save the exact site position.

7
00:00:29,770 --> 00:00:35,833
When the customer is happy, tick Customer confirmed completion, give their rating,

8
00:00:35,833 --> 00:00:38,568
set the status to Completed and save.

9
00:00:39,450 --> 00:00:45,243
Take the completion photos with Site photo: each is stamped with the place and time

10
00:00:45,243 --> 00:00:48,873
and filed on the installation, customer and project.

11
00:00:49,770 --> 00:00:54,786
Print gives the Installation and Commissioning Certificate for the customer to

12
00:00:54,786 --> 00:00:57,873
sign, with the checklist and the system details.

13
00:00:59,020 --> 00:01:03,206
Next video: PM Surya Ghar subsidy and solar loans.

